---
import WysFrame from '../../components/WysFrame.astro';
import WysNightFeed from '../../components/WysNightFeed.astro';
import FreebieForm from '../../components/FreebieForm.astro';
import WysCta from '../../components/WysCta.astro';
import WysOvernight from '../../components/WysOvernight.astro';
import WysLinks from '../../components/WysLinks.astro';
import WysWhen from '../../components/WysWhen.astro';
import WysProof from '../../components/WysProof.astro';
import WysYouDo from '../../components/WysYouDo.astro';
import WysObjections from '../../components/WysObjections.astro';
import WysOffer from '../../components/WysOffer.astro';
import {liveLooks} from '../../data/wys-live.js';
const [ghost] = liveLooks;
---
<WysFrame focus title="The While-You-Sleep Storefront™ | Your Amazon storefront posts itself" description="Every night, The While-You-Sleep Storefront™ plans and sources 2 looks, posts 6 Pinterest pins, 2 blog posts and 2 Instagram carousels. Member presale is open now." ogImage={ghost.photos.styled.src.src}>
 <header class="wc-hero">
  <div class="wys-wrap wc-wait-grid">
   <div class="wc-hero-copy">
    <p class="wc-kicker">For Amazon storefront owners</p>
    <h1 class="wh-name">The <span class="wh-nb">While-You-Sleep</span> Storefront™</h1>
    <p class="wh-sub">Your Amazon storefront <em>posts itself.</em></p>
    <p class="wc-hero-line">It’s not a guide. It’s the system that runs my own storefront, set up once on your computer. Every night it plans and sources <b>2&nbsp;looks</b>, makes 6 Pinterest pins, writes 2 blog posts and posts 2 Instagram carousels, while you sleep.</p>
    <div class="wc-wait-form wc-buy-box" id="buy" data-wys-when="launch regular">
     <span class="wc-example-tag" style="left:28px;transform:rotate(-2deg)" data-wys-when="launch">Launch weekend</span>
     <p class="wc-buy-h">The While-You-Sleep Storefront™</p>
     <p class="wc-buy-price" data-wys-when="launch">$27 <s>$37</s></p>
     <p class="wc-buy-price" data-wys-when="regular">$37</p>
     <p class="wc-buy-p" data-wys-when="launch">Launch weekend price. $37 after launch weekend.</p>
     <p class="wc-buy-p" data-wys-when="regular">One payment.</p>
     <WysCta align="left"/>
    </div>
    <WysLinks current="overview" buy/>
    <div class="wc-wait-form" data-wys-when="wait presale" id="join-top">
     <p class="wc-buy-h">Member presale is open now.</p>
     <p class="wc-buy-p">TDIE Skool members get first access at the presale price, inside the community. Full launch is Friday 16 October at 12 pm ET.</p>
     <FreebieForm action="/api/wys-waitlist" heading="Get a notification when it opens" button="Notify me" sub="Pop in your email and we’ll email you the moment it opens, Friday 16 October at 12 pm ET. Unsubscribe anytime." done="You’re on the list. We’ll email you the moment it opens." emailLabel="Email address for the launch notification"/>
    </div>
   </div>
   <div class="wc-hero-phone"><WysNightFeed/></div>
  </div>
 </header>

 <div class="wc-tagband" style="background-image:url(/images/brand/gl-tile.webp)"><p class="wc-tagline">Planned. Pinned. Posted. Blogged. <span>You Slept.</span><small>The Digital Income Edit™ presents The While-You-Sleep Storefront™</small></p></div>

 <section class="wys-wrap wc-section">
  <div class="wc-pain-grid">
   <div class="wc-head">
    <p class="wc-kicker">Sound familiar?</p>
    <h2>You built the storefront.<br/><em>Then: crickets.</em></h2>
    <p class="wc-body">You made the Idea Lists. You put your storefront link everywhere you could. And the clicks never came, because the clicks only come if you post. Every single day.</p>
    <p class="wc-body">Pinterest wants fresh pins. The blog wants a post. Instagram wants a carousel. And every morning you wake up asking the same thing: what do I post today?</p>
    <ul class="wc-checks">
     <li>Making pins feels endless</li>
     <li>The storefront sits there with zero clicks</li>
     <li>You’re burned out, and you haven’t even started today’s post</li>
    </ul>
   </div>
   <figure class="wc-pullquote">
    <blockquote>Passive income isn’t passive.</blockquote>
    <p>Not the way most of us were sold it. This is the truly hands-off version. Set it up once. Then no more building, selling or posting. No constantly building lists.</p>
   </figure>
  </div>
 </section>

 <section class="wc-section" style="background:#fff">
  <div class="wys-wrap">
   <div class="wc-head">
    <p class="wc-kicker">Every night, while you sleep</p>
    <h2>You go to bed.<br/><em>It goes to work.</em></h2>
    <p>In the morning, 2 finished, shoppable looks are already out in the world: 6 pins, 2 blog posts and 2 carousels. Pinterest and Google are search engines, so a pin or a post keeps getting found long after the day it goes up. A feed forgets you by lunch.</p>
   </div>
   <WysOvernight/>
  </div>
 </section>

 <section class="wys-wrap wc-section">
  <div class="wc-head">
   <p class="wc-kicker">The proof</p>
   <h2>Two blog posts it built.<br/><em>Both live right now.</em></h2>
   <p>Open them. These are the real pages on The Digital Income Edit™ Lifestyle blog, with the finds linked and the photos in order.</p>
  </div>
  <WysProof/>
  <p class="wc-flow-note wc-look-link"><a href="/shop/while-you-sleep-storefront/real-results">See my real results: every photo, pin and carousel it made for both looks →</a></p>
  <WysCta href="#join" timedNote/>
 </section>

 <section class="wys-wrap wc-section" style="padding-top:0">
  <figure class="wc-founder">
   <blockquote><span>I built this to run my own storefront.</span> <span>I refuse to gatekeep it.</span></blockquote>
   <p>It’s the system behind the looks on my own Lifestyle blog. Now it can run yours.</p>
   <cite>Jodie, founder of The Digital Income Edit™</cite>
  </figure>
 </section>

 <section class="wc-section" style="background:#fff">
  <div class="wys-wrap">
   <div class="wc-head">
    <p class="wc-kicker">You do / It does</p>
    <h2>Set it up once.<br/><em>It does the rest.</em></h2>
   </div>
   <WysYouDo/>
  </div>
 </section>

 <section class="wys-wrap wc-section">
  <div class="wc-head">
   <p class="wc-kicker">Made for</p>
   <h2>Storefront owners who are<br/><em>done posting every day.</em></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="wc-who">
   <div><h3>Amazon Influencers and storefront owners</h3><p>You know you should be on Pinterest, a blog and Instagram. You don’t have the time or the energy to post every day.</p></div>
   <div><h3>Owners of The Weekend Ecosystem™</h3><p>Your site is already built. This fills its blog with shoppable posts without adding another daily job.</p></div>
   <div><h3>TDIE Skool members</h3><p><WysWhen wait="Members buy first, from Tuesday 13 October: $10 for Premium, $17 for Standard." launch="Members bought first at $10 and $17. Missed it? Members get a last-chance $17 code inside Skool, launch weekend only." regular="Members bought first, at $10 for Premium and $17 for Standard."/> <WysWhen wait="The affiliate program opens Friday 16 October." launch="The affiliate program is open now."/></p></div>
  </div>
 </section>

 <section class="wc-section" style="background:#fff">
  <div class="wys-wrap">
   <div class="wc-head">
    <p class="wc-kicker">Questions</p>
    <h2>Your questions,<br/><em>answered straight.</em></h2>
   </div>
   <WysObjections/>
   <WysCta href="#offer" label="See the member price" timedNote/>
  </div>
 </section>

 <section class="wys-wrap wc-section">
  <div class="wc-head">
   <p class="wc-kicker" id="offer">The offer</p>
   <h2>Members first.<br/><em>Then everyone.</em></h2>
   <p>It’s a website, not a PDF, so it never goes stale. Regular updates, with new affiliate brand automations on the way.</p>
  </div>
  <WysOffer/>
 </section>

 <div class="wc-final" style="background-image:url(/images/brand/gl-tile.webp)">
  <div class="wc-final-card">
   <p class="wc-kicker">The While-You-Sleep Storefront™</p>
   <h2>Go to bed.<br/><em>Wake up posted.</em></h2>
   <div class="wc-wait-form" id="join" data-wys-when="wait presale">
    <FreebieForm action="/api/wys-waitlist" heading="Get a notification when it opens" button="Notify me" sub="Pop in your email and we’ll email you the moment it opens, Friday 16 October at 12 pm ET. Unsubscribe anytime." done="You’re on the list. We’ll email you the moment it opens." emailLabel="Email address for the launch notification"/>
   </div>
   <div class="wc-cta" data-wys-when="launch regular"><WysCta timedNote/></div>
  </div>
 </div>
</WysFrame>
<style is:global>
 .wys-world .wc-final-card .wc-wait-form .freebie-capture{border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;padding:6px 0 0!important}
 .wys-world .wc-final-card .wc-wait-form .fc-h,.wys-world .wc-final-card .wc-wait-form .fc-sub{text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
 .wys-world .wc-look-link{text-align:center;margin:28px auto 0}
 .wys-world .wc-look-link a{font:700 16px/1.4 Jost,sans-serif;color:#B8245F;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px}
</style>
